# Hot bore in a square block: 300 C on the hole, 20 C on the outer faces, heat leaking nowhere else.
title Heat conduction around a hot bore
material E=1 nu=0.3 t=1 k=45
mesh quarterhole a=1 L=6 nr=16 nt=24 type=tri6
temp where r<=1 t=300
temp where x>=6 t=20
temp where y>=6 t=20
solve solver=cg-ic0
